{
"file": 17,
"paths": [
"d002/f613"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "02dedfca",
"en_raw": "In the drain hole by the Tama River"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "0fc78d07",
"en_raw": "there's Mizuko's spirit and a white croc"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "db3fbf61",
"en_raw": "What do you do about such stupidity?"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "979e439b",
"en_raw": "What do I do? Nothing"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "8d826165",
"en_raw": "just ignore it"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "f215b96b",
"en_raw": "But can you really get into"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "6d1ef316",
"en_raw": "the Tama River drain hole?"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "f15f250d",
"en_raw": "Even if you can, it's no good"
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "8622cac0",
"en_raw": "No, I think it'd just stink"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "04430a72",
"en_raw": "but..."
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "4903dd2c",
"en_raw": "Hey Shiina, what do you think?"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "363310f6",
"en_raw": "A walk in a narrow dark hole"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "77784cb8",
"en_raw": "that leads who knows where"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "52870f74",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see the crocodile"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "535e2c46",
"en_raw": "I often see it in my dreams"
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "664153e7",
"en_raw": "No exit in sight"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "4a90a20c",
"en_raw": "Drifting in a pitch-black hole"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "92f3742e",
"en_raw": "A weird dream..."
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "91620ebe",
"en_raw": "People somehow might have"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "6a92478b",
"en_raw": "a trait of being drawn to dark holes"
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "c1d5fd8d",
"en_raw": "or something..."
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "52870f74",
"en_raw": "Kurumi wants to see the crocodile"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "003cd7c4",
"en_raw": "Hey Shiina, shall we go in?"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "195e4b91",
"en_raw": "Shall we go?"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "df98f8de",
"en_raw": "So in the end we'll go where"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "a18ffb37",
"en_raw": "Sango wants to go"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "818f9546",
"en_raw": "Because the places Nao goes"
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "87ecaf57",
"en_raw": "aren't fun"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "15d4804a",
"en_raw": "Hey Nao, a sewer,"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "c90a683c",
"en_raw": "where do you get in?"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "012461a4",
"en_raw": "The hole under the Tama River bank"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "8c9d7a2d",
"en_raw": "is probably it, right?"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "88abf1b0",
"en_raw": "But you can't get in there"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "e5e0a92a",
"en_raw": "You won't know until you go"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "ab96bfd8",
"en_raw": "We did get in, but..."
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "46262920",
"en_raw": "It was even worse"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "ddae8f35",
"en_raw": "than I'd imagined"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "1b4f26be",
"en_raw": "It was definitely a gross"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "23d7f4d1",
"en_raw": "place"
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "e0a919b3",
"en_raw": "But I"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "26ad860b",
"en_raw": "had a weird feeling"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "b4d058b1",
"en_raw": "No crocodile, huh"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "693bc667",
"en_raw": "Hey Sango, what's"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "0e9b4ee8",
"en_raw": "back there, I wonder..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "349ba4c1",
"en_raw": "If Nao says he can't go"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "b3becd57",
"en_raw": "I'll go, but..."
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "f37768bd",
"en_raw": "I don't feel like it..."
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "76f923f7",
"en_raw": "Forget the white crocodile"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "4e603d51",
"en_raw": "coming back alive was a miracle"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "37d24b36",
"en_raw": "Sango, didn't you feel"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "d36019a9",
"en_raw": "anything in that place?"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "774882fc",
"en_raw": "...Feel what?"
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "2ed00555",
"en_raw": "I don't know, how to put it"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "3f27579e",
"en_raw": "...a weird feeling"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "7c0d9aa2",
"en_raw": "What's that?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "84eed3f4",
"en_raw": "Sango, you said"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "f32c8608",
"en_raw": "people are drawn to dark holes..."
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "e56e4095",
"en_raw": "Oh, that was a lie"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "a0c5ebd7",
"en_raw": "I mean, Nao"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "b5cb08e0",
"en_raw": "in a life-and-death"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "bd64c0b8",
"en_raw": "situation like that"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "71105256",
"en_raw": "where would I have the time"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "7ddca890",
"en_raw": "to get all sensitive?"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "c81102e0",
"en_raw": "But that place where the light came in"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "9bbb3cb5",
"en_raw": "was really strange..."
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "165aa208",
"en_raw": "right... it felt nostalgic"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "7871da88",
"en_raw": "I felt nostalgic"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "05133fd3",
"en_raw": "I haven't been this scared since"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "2758c437",
"en_raw": "the elementary school field trip"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "4c9aa8f9",
"en_raw": "when I sat on a caterpillar"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "c385d65a",
"en_raw": "with my backside..."
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "771f9015",
"en_raw": "...Listen"
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "fd452c6d",
"en_raw": "I want to go once more, but"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "3457d205",
"en_raw": "I've had enough"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "355c33c0",
"en_raw": "If you want to go so badly"
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "5e3bacd2",
"en_raw": "Nao, you go first"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "fadeb2d5",
"en_raw": "ahead into that darkness"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "ebb38bb3",
"en_raw": "Anyway, hey"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "778e76ce",
"en_raw": "let's go once more"
},
{
"n": 79,
"h": "bd105dfe",
"en_raw": "I feel like"
},
{
"n": 80,
"h": "2843590c",
"en_raw": "there's something there"
},
{
"n": 81,
"h": "fa531a1d",
"en_raw": "Nao, what's gotten into you?"
},
{
"n": 82,
"h": "6a745f05",
"en_raw": "Hey, this..."
},
{
"n": 83,
"h": "1d89b492",
"en_raw": "It's a face, isn't it?"
},
{
"n": 84,
"h": "63f15d12",
"en_raw": "It might look like one"
},
{
"n": 85,
"h": "58cfef15",
"en_raw": "A baby's crying voice"
},
{
"n": 86,
"h": "e589cee7",
"en_raw": "A stone with a baby's face..."
},
{
"n": 87,
"h": "dbf52814",
"en_raw": "You're overthinking it"
},
{
"n": 88,
"h": "d9b6439f",
"en_raw": "What should I do with this stone..."
},
{
"n": 89,
"h": "bac64dd6",
"en_raw": "What do you mean, throw it away?"
},
{
"n": 90,
"h": "45d40433",
"en_raw": "Throw it where?"
},
{
"n": 91,
"h": "2f8d77ab",
"en_raw": "Is there a place"
},
{
"n": 92,
"h": "1affac92",
"en_raw": "for throwing away stones?"
},
{
"n": 93,
"h": "9410a134",
"en_raw": "Leave it on the riverbank?"
},
{
"n": 94,
"h": "af4e4e44",
"en_raw": "If that'll satisfy you"
},
{
"n": 95,
"h": "5407dd9c",
"en_raw": "You're throwing out that nice stone?"
},
{
"n": 96,
"h": "99f86293",
"en_raw": "If you're throwing it, Kurumi"
},
{
"n": 97,
"h": "e48b60c4",
"en_raw": "will take it"
},
{
"n": 98,
"h": "ab2e295a",
"en_raw": "No"
},
{
"n": 99,
"h": "e4360720",
"en_raw": "Then, as a souvenir"
},
{
"n": 100,
"h": "8ce236e4",
"en_raw": "for Kasuka-chan?"
},
{
"n": 101,
"h": "92b2b7bc",
"en_raw": "Really, no"
},
{
"n": 102,
"h": "8834a69d",
"en_raw": "You say that, Shiina, but"
},
{
"n": 103,
"h": "b288f685",
"en_raw": "you'll keep it for yourself"
},
{
"n": 104,
"h": "4151860d",
"en_raw": "Nao, you're mean!"
},
{
"n": 105,
"h": "eb962f6b",
"en_raw": "Just give it to her"
},
{
"n": 106,
"h": "8339245e",
"en_raw": "Why are you so fixated?"
},
{
"n": 107,
"h": "f0487645",
"en_raw": "I'm not really"
},
{
"n": 108,
"h": "c948ff8f",
"en_raw": "fixated"
},
{
"n": 109,
"h": "a3d78b2c",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 110,
"h": "74e97a06",
"en_raw": "I think maybe I should return it"
},
{
"n": 111,
"h": "93f56c24",
"en_raw": "Return Rome's things to Rome, huh"
},
{
"n": 112,
"h": "76fefa85",
"en_raw": "But I'm never going"
},
{
"n": 113,
"h": "dae3495e",
"en_raw": "in there again"
},
{
"n": 114,
"h": "6f7a5250",
"en_raw": "Then at least"
},
{
"n": 115,
"h": "24669d27",
"en_raw": "let's put it back in the river"
},
{
"n": 116,
"h": "c58c802c",
"en_raw": "We could get down to the riverbank"
},
{
"n": 117,
"h": "becb5ced",
"en_raw": "past the embankment road, right?"
},
{
"n": 118,
"h": "ff27f7c9",
"en_raw": "How kind of you..."
},
{
"n": 119,
"h": "6f01a0eb",
"en_raw": "...What should I do with this stone?"
},
{
"n": 120,
"h": "f8de8a86",
"en_raw": "That's why, if you're hesitating"
},
{
"n": 121,
"h": "2b327300",
"en_raw": "just give it to Shiina"
},
{
"n": 122,
"h": "76a8d42a",
"en_raw": "Kurumi will show it"
},
{
"n": 123,
"h": "261e5308",
"en_raw": "to Kasuka-chan"
},
{
"n": 124,
"h": "0d475bae",
"en_raw": "Hey, in the end, what was"
},
{
"n": 125,
"h": "f9e41284",
"en_raw": "that place..."
},
{
"n": 126,
"h": "cab01d7d",
"en_raw": "What, now that the stone"
},
{
"n": 127,
"h": "7a839900",
"en_raw": "has been dealt with,"
},
{
"n": 128,
"h": "fd4f1b09",
"en_raw": "you are back on that again?"
},
{
"n": 129,
"h": "7a760052",
"en_raw": "It was a shiny place"
},
{
"n": 130,
"h": "21cb2d24",
"en_raw": "Why was only that spot"
},
{
"n": 131,
"h": "df024060",
"en_raw": "glowing..."
},
{
"n": 132,
"h": "d0b24ed6",
"en_raw": "Light must have been leaking"
},
{
"n": 133,
"h": "bdfc9b15",
"en_raw": "from the manhole above"
},
{
"n": 134,
"h": "5ef4d137",
"en_raw": "Then that crying voice or..."
},
{
"n": 135,
"h": "5abba78f",
"en_raw": "Stop it, you're not"
},
{
"n": 136,
"h": "391db3e1",
"en_raw": "the Toilet Gang"
},
{
"n": 137,
"h": "472ee991",
"en_raw": "It's your imagination"
},
{
"n": 138,
"h": "490f216e",
"en_raw": "But..."
},
{
"n": 139,
"h": "e757bd6e",
"en_raw": "Then, Nao"
},
{
"n": 140,
"h": "38783f0f",
"en_raw": "why not check yourself which"
},
{
"n": 141,
"h": "b845b2b2",
"en_raw": "manhole it was?"
},
{
"n": 142,
"h": "4e63cc06",
"en_raw": "That hole turned right a few times"
},
{
"n": 143,
"h": "4d74ade4",
"en_raw": "but was mostly straight, right?"
},
{
"n": 144,
"h": "786fafd2",
"en_raw": "I think we walked quite a way..."
},
{
"n": 145,
"h": "71d83eb2",
"en_raw": "Don't put much trust in"
},
{
"n": 146,
"h": "12d8d909",
"en_raw": "'we walked quite a way'"
},
{
"n": 147,
"h": "5e7f5a76",
"en_raw": "By my gut, let's see"
},
{
"n": 148,
"h": "7d391c9c",
"en_raw": "at most we reached Hospital Street"
},
{
"n": 149,
"h": "accf7700",
"en_raw": "A manhole on Hospital Street..."
},
{
"n": 150,
"h": "148ed6ac",
"en_raw": "Don't take it too seriously"
},
{
"n": 151,
"h": "5f759e2d",
"en_raw": "So we were..."
},
{
"n": 152,
"h": "b2076711",
"en_raw": "crawling under the maternity clinic"
},
{
"n": 153,
"h": "6420317f",
"en_raw": "then"
},
{
"n": 154,
"h": "1906b15d",
"en_raw": "You know what a maternity clinic"
},
{
"n": 155,
"h": "7aebf36a",
"en_raw": "is, right?"
},
{
"n": 156,
"h": "51e0125b",
"en_raw": "...Where babies are born?"
},
{
"n": 157,
"h": "7a4ebde2",
"en_raw": "Correct"
},
{
"n": 158,
"h": "e48b4ce9",
"en_raw": "Which means"
},
{
"n": 159,
"h": "6343f574",
"en_raw": "the disinfectant smell I noticed"
},
{
"n": 160,
"h": "4b4958eb",
"en_raw": "and the baby crying Nao heard"
},
{
"n": 161,
"h": "79e38e42",
"en_raw": "both make sense, right?"
},
{
"n": 162,
"h": "d1d55943",
"en_raw": "Yeah, well, that's true, but..."
},
{
"n": 163,
"h": "991edbe4",
"en_raw": "But what about"
},
{
"n": 164,
"h": "a5f4a0ac",
"en_raw": "that stone..."
},
{
"n": 165,
"h": "b18476e2",
"en_raw": "That was just a stone"
},
{
"n": 166,
"h": "6b1352fb",
"en_raw": "...Come to think of it"
},
{
"n": 167,
"h": "f34fbf2c",
"en_raw": "we should've shown that stone"
},
{
"n": 168,
"h": "97e019af",
"en_raw": "to Yuasa instead of throwing it"
},
{
"n": 169,
"h": "62b14bc3",
"en_raw": "Dressing up this story"
},
{
"n": 170,
"h": "d83fdabf",
"en_raw": "in all sorts of ways"
},
{
"n": 171,
"h": "98956a01",
"en_raw": "that little guy might"
},
{
"n": 172,
"h": "7db1ca90",
"en_raw": "have fallen for it"
},
{
"n": 173,
"h": "6266bbbb",
"en_raw": "Still, it was kind of nice"
},
{
"n": 174,
"h": "2268bcc6",
"en_raw": "What was nice?"
},
{
"n": 175,
"h": "d6311754",
"en_raw": "That she seems like a good mom"
},
{
"n": 176,
"h": "3907e5c5",
"en_raw": "That feeling"
},
{
"n": 177,
"h": "35a5eb62",
"en_raw": "I have no idea"
},
{
"n": 178,
"h": "85568e2d",
"en_raw": "If you're glad, I'm glad"
},
{
"n": 179,
"h": "7b6ebce1",
"en_raw": "Hey hey, Sango"
},
{
"n": 180,
"h": "6922aea5",
"en_raw": "What's a Mizuko?"
},
{
"n": 181,
"h": "fa81f815",
"en_raw": "...Dunno"
},
{
"n": 182,
"h": "ec06e43f",
"en_raw": "Solved the rumor of the Mizuko"
},
{
"n": 183,
"h": "e89154f9",
"en_raw": "What shocked me was that"
},
{
"n": 184,
"h": "6e64f80f",
"en_raw": "what flows into the Tama River"
},
{
"n": 185,
"h": "bd5d58ce",
"en_raw": "isn't sewage"
},
{
"n": 186,
"h": "6a4b4ade",
"en_raw": "but household drainage"
},
{
"n": 187,
"h": "2184b3fd",
"en_raw": "Not even knowing that"
},
{
"n": 188,
"h": "4cbb100f",
"en_raw": "I was totally embarrassed"
},
{
"n": 189,
"h": "14f5784c",
"en_raw": "Enough, drop it"
},
{
"n": 190,
"h": "da16b673",
"en_raw": "Let's talk about something else already!"
}
]
}